	(text "6 x XINGLIGHT XL-5050RGBW-2812B-HM daisy-chained (WS2812B protocol: 24-bit GRB,\n800 kHz; standard WS2812B pinout 1 VDD / 2 DOUT / 3 VSS / 4 DIN; 'W' = white diffused lens).\n3.3 V -> 5 V data: Q1 (2N7002) + R9 (3.3k pull-up to 5 V) form a non-inverting level shifter\n(gate at 3V3, source to the XIAO, drain to the first pixel's DIN). V_IH = 0.7 x 5 V = 3.5 V is then met with margin;\nrise time ~2.2 x 3.3k x 15 pF ~ 110 ns (WS2812 T0H = 400 +-150 ns). Q1/R9 sit near the first pixel.\nC4-C9: 100 nF per pixel (datasheet application circuit) - place each one right at\nits pixel's VDD/VSS pads. C3 = 22 uF bulk for the chain.\nWorst case ~36-60 mA per pixel at full white -> firmware power budget applies."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 68.58 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "00666791-5cf9-5ad2-a426-eb9ca0527f8d")
	)
